        <mxCell id="narr" value="1  The provider hands over the material they already have.        2  The companion checks in, weekly, one question.        3  The family answers with one tap.        4  A trained model names the situation.&#10;5  The answer comes back out of the provider&apos;s own material.        6  When a person is needed, it goes to the provider&apos;s consultant, not ours.        7  The provider sees what happened, under their own brand." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#161D1A" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="612" width="1280" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="caveat" value="Sketch, 2026-09-10. Nothing is built and no provider has replied. G4 closes 2026-10-15 at 1 commitment of 22, time or money (re-registered 14.09.2026, superseding &quot;4 replies of 20&quot;)." style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=11;fontColor=#A34D26" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="666" width="900" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
